#   ef1c165cc595aa122d284eb92547c9f5dab513fb
#   e5a9fb752e0dcc127dd1740316c853571c16052f
#   8f15190c230fe6975c9b18e31316c6bc494f3863
# Compatibility adaptations:
#   - Keep the v1.8.20 SniffQUIC API and single-packet behavior.
#   - Replace post-v1.8.20 buf.NewWithSize/ownership APIs with the existing bytespool API plus explicit bounds.
#   - Apply the d9ebb9b2dc sampling and CRYPTO-buffer safety semantics without importing its newer dispatcher/buffer refactor.
#   - Keep XrayR 0.9.4 app/mydispatcher unchanged; its fixed buf.Size cache path has no equivalent NewWithSize dependency.
#   - Add no newer xray-core protocol, configuration, panel, or routing behavior.
